Sylvester’s Inequality: Additional Insights
• With d as the dimension of intersection of R(B) and N (A)
ρ(AB) = ρ(B) − d
dim N (A) = n − ρ(A) =⇒ d ≤ n − ρ(A)
• Combining the above results
